{"kind": "node", "eid": "4:07776e6c-a4f0-44b3-a32d-f8d475c6ae09:941", "labels": ["Chunk"], "props": {"section_title": "", "embeddingText": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "source_type": "text", "memory_id": "0ced7478-fa7e-4641-9508-abd7f16faa80", "_source_id": "0ced7478-fa7e-4641-9508-abd7f16faa80", "id": "0ced7478-fa7e-4641-9508-abd7f16faa80_chunk_0000", "_ontology_name": "fibo_sub", "created_at": "2026-08-02T04:04:00.169726+00:00", "char_start": 0, "_workspace_id": "armv2-e-minimax27-c2373adb", "content_preview": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "token_count": 58, "chunk_id": "0ced7478-fa7e-4641-9508-abd7f16faa80_chunk_0000", "_ontology_version": "1.0.0", "_ontology_artifact_hash": "91e8b908bed81620", "text": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "embedding_vector_id": "0ced7478-fa7e-4641-9508-abd7f16faa80_chunk_0000", "status": "active", "document_id": "0ced7478-fa7e-4641-9508-abd7f16faa80_doc", "source_id": "0ced7478-fa7e-4641-9508-a